            },
            {
              "id": "the-king-s-cure:bring:xr8wqw",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Yeti_hair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yeti hair</a>",
              "text": "Yeti hair"
            }
          ],
          "recommended": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-king-s-cure:4fwl7u",
          "html": "Ensure you have the standard spellbook enabled.",
          "text": "Ensure you have the standard spellbook enabled.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-king-s-cure:itycfl",
          "html": "Travel to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mountain_Camp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mountain Camp</a>. (Fairy code <b>A</b><b>J</b><b>R</b> or east of the Fremennik Province lodestone.)",
          "text": "Travel to the Mountain Camp. (Fairy code AJR or east of the Fremennik Province lodestone.)",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "the-king-s-cure:itycfl:7kuiih",
              "html": "A pole and plank can be found near the goats if you didn&#39;t bring a staff and plank.",
              "text": "A pole and plank can be found near the goats if you didn't bring a staff and plank.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-king-s-cure:145gmcz",
          "html": "Climb the tree next to the lake, use the staff/pole on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Clump_of_rocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">clump of rocks</a>, then use the plank on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Flat_stone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">flat stone</a>.",
          "text": "Climb the tree next to the lake, use the staff/pole on the clump of rocks, then use the plank on the flat stone.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-king-s-cure:99vb4",
          "html": "Stand south of the rocks and <i>listen-to</i> a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Shining_pool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shining pool</a> in the water.",
          "text": "Stand south of the rocks and listen-to a shining pool in the water.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "the-king-s-cure:99vb4:1b99rqc",
              "html": "If the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Diamond_root\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">diamond root</a> was not placed in your backpack, open the herb pouch with at least one available backpack space.",
              "text": "If the diamond root was not placed in your backpack, open the herb pouch with at least one available backpack space.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-king-s-cure:uvo5yn",
          "html": "<i>Use</i> your vial on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Spring_(Glorious_Memories)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">spring</a> that appeared on the rock near you.",
          "text": "Use your vial on the spring that appeared on the rock near you.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-king-s-cure:xydq37",
          "html": "<i>Use</i> a clean irit on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vial_of_mountain_water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vial of mountain water</a> for a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mountain_irit_potion_(unfinished)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mountain irit potion (unfinished)</a>.",
          "text": "Use a clean irit on the vial of mountain water for a mountain irit potion (unfinished).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-king-s-cure:ro0oy4",
          "html": "<i>Grind</i> the diamond root, cast <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lvl-4_Enchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lvl-4 Enchant</a> on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Diamond_root_dust\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">diamond root dust</a>, then <i>use</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Enchanted_diamond_root_dust\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">enchanted diamond root dust</a> and yeti hair to the unfinished vial to make <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Yeti_curse_cure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">yeti curse cure</a>.",
